: Two wrists beside one another Two forearms touching Two shoulders meeting Two calves aligned Two hands approaching Two backs beside one another The connection must actually work geometrically. Do not fake a connection that would be impossible on real bodies. INDEPENDENT MATCHING PRESENTATION When the tattoos do NOT physically connect, allow the two people to stand naturally. They do not need to touch. The viewer simply needs to see both tattoos clearly enough to understand their relationship. One tattoo may be: On a finger while the other is: On a wrist. One may be: Behind an ear while the other is: On an arm. One may be: On a thigh while the other is: On a shoulder. THAT IS INTENTIONAL'
